      "content": "## Test Case: [TC-005] Remember Me — Session Does NOT Persist Without Checkbox\n\n**Type:** Functional\n**Priority:** Medium\n\n### Preconditions\n- Registered user account: `test@demo.com` / `Test1234!`\n- Browser has no existing session cookie\n\n### Test Steps\n| Step | Action | Expected Result |\n|------|--------|-----------------|\n| 1 | Navigate to `/login` | Login page displayed |\n| 2 | Enter valid email and password; leave \"Remember me\" **unchecked** | Fields populated, checkbox unchecked |\n| 3 | Click \"Sign In\" | User redirected to `/dashboard`; auth token is a session cookie (no `max-age` / `expires` attribute) |\n| 4 | Close the browser completely and reopen it | Browser starts a fresh session |\n| 5 | Navigate to `/dashboard` | User is **not** authenticated; redirected to `/login` |\n\n### Expected Outcome\nWithout \"Remember me\", the auth token is a session cookie that expires on browser close.\n\n---",
